{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:11 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:11 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:11 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"西九銀行有人用5張百元假美金存款 警拘66歲台男。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47319717cd5bbfb3d7ee8edbbb2e0562/2026-11/police_yaumatei.jpg\"/><p>西九柯士甸道西1號一銀行，今日（11月26日）有職員報案，指懷疑有人以5張各面值100美元的懷疑偽鈔存款。警員接報到場，經初步調查，將66歲姓黃的台灣男子，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕。他現正被扣留調查，案件由油尖警區刑事調查隊第四隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.450901+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:11:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:30.830411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.265572+00:00","content_hash":"1655e165768ce9cae75fc34bbe2c5990be9b3f2910c5efeaa8063b6f41cc3fd6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}